{"type":"standard","title":"Ekoka ǃKung","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Ekoka ǃKung</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q616533","titles":{"canonical":"Ekoka_ǃKung","normalized":"Ekoka ǃKung","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Ekoka ǃKung</span></span>"},"pageid":34314219,"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1326143655","tid":"ad30850a-d34f-11f0-90d1-4b85d2c946fb","timestamp":"2025-12-07T09:32:41Z","description":"ǃKung language of Southern Africa","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ekoka_%C7%83Kung","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ekoka_%C7%83Kung?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ekoka_%C7%83Kung?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Ekoka_%C7%83Kung"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ekoka_%C7%83Kung","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Ekoka_%C7%83Kung","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ekoka_%C7%83Kung?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Ekoka_%C7%83Kung"}},"extract":"Ekoka ǃKung or Western ǃXuun is a variety of the ǃKung dialect cluster, spoken originally in the area of the central Namibian–Angolan border, west of the Okavango River, but since the Angolan Civil War also in South Africa.","extract_html":"<p><b>Ekoka ǃKung</b> or <b>Western ǃXuun</b> is a variety of the ǃKung dialect cluster, spoken originally in the area of the central Namibian–Angolan border, west of the Okavango River, but since the Angolan Civil War also in South Africa.</p>"}